WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Getting your free AI key. Verba needs a free AI key from a company called Groq. Use a personal email, not your school email unless school staff say it’s OK. If you’re under 18, have a parent or guardian do this with you.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1: Go to groq.com. Click “Start Building” in the top right corner.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Step 2: Type your personal email address. Don’t use your school email unless a teacher or school staff member says it’s OK.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 2: Click “Continue with email”.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.900
Step 3: Groq sends you an email with a sign-in link. Go open it now.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:37.900
Check your email. Find the message from Groq (check Spam or Junk too) and click the link inside to sign in.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.900
Step 4: Click “API Keys” at the top of the page. Then click “Create API Key”.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:49.067
Step 4: If you see a “Verify you are human” check, wait a moment or tick the box.

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:57.217
Step 5: Type any name for your key, like “Verba”. Leave Expiration as “No expiration”. Click “Submit”.

00:00:57.217 --> 00:01:06.529
Step 6: Your key appears here. Click “Copy” and save it somewhere right away. Groq shows it only once!

00:01:06.529 --> 00:01:10.279
Step 6: Click “Done”. If you ever lose your key, you can make a new one on this page.

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:19.279
You did it! Paste your key into Verba’s “AI API key” box, and save it somewhere safe. Never share it.
